      "updated_at": "2018-07-29T20:43:12Z",
      "body": "we have set up a team for GDPR enhancements of DNN - please read http://www.dnnsoftware.com/community-blog/cid/155590/gdpr-compliance-looking-for-volunteers . From my experience, Cookie Consent is currently subject of discussion within EU site owners, and there is no real clear regulation from the EU atm, as ePrivacy directive - which should clarify, how to implement appropriate solutions, has not yet been released by the EU.\r\n\r\n",
